Today is the end of day 1.

reply:
{
  "actions": [
    {"type": "set_log_filter", "rule": "exclude refunds"},
    {"type": "set_order_qty", "item": "oat milk", "qty": 30}
  ],
  "predictions": {
    "oat_milk_unfilled_requests": 0,
    "sub5_raise_rate": 0.55,
    "nightly_reconciliation_discrepancy": 48.0,
    "bank_settlement_shortfall": null
  },
  "notes": "Set log filter to exclude refunds and order additional oat milk to address stockouts."
}

